  "cusanCommit": "2e2a503cb65c1fc9fcf61816aac6a55e1d854dc1",
  "build": "CuSan built against the LLVM 23.1.3 release package (its LLVMConfig needs a zstd::libzstd_static target; the system libzstd.so.1 was given as that target) after the four LLVM API changes in probes/cusan-llvm23.patch; CuSan's authors test LLVM 14, 18 and 19. The LLVM 23.1.3 source build used for the checker has no NVPTX target and no ThreadSanitizer runtime.",
